# Classic light scheme. Values follow the well-known classic 3D desktop palette:
#   face 212,208,200   highlight 255,255,255   shadow 128,128,128   dark shadow 64,64,64
#   selection / active title 10,36,106 -> 166,202,240   inactive title 128,128,128 -> 192,192,192

